  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: f424be585f9e04c79a96c8292e8b9db1, type: 3}
  m_Name: Evento_EfeitoNIMBY
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Metis.Runtime::KnowledgeEntryData
  _title: Efeito NIMBY
  _titleEn: NIMBY Effect
  _category: 1
  _unlockTrigger: 0
  _summary: "NIMBY, do ingl\xEAs n\xE3o no meu quintal, \xE9 a oposi\xE7\xE3o de
    moradores a obras que todos acham necess\xE1rias, desde que fiquem em outro bairro."
  _summaryEn: NIMBY, short for not in my backyard, is residents' opposition to projects
    everyone agrees are needed, as long as they go somewhere else.
  _realWorld: "Esta\xE7\xF5es de transporte, abrigos, aterros e moradia popular s\xE3o
    alvos frequentes de oposi\xE7\xE3o organizada, que atrasa ou muda de lugar as
    obras."
  _realWorldEn: Transit stations, shelters, landfills and affordable housing are
    frequent targets of organized opposition, which delays or relocates projects.
  _tradeOffs: Ouvir os moradores cedo e compensar os impactos ajuda; ceder sempre
    empurra os projetos para bairros sem voz.
  _tradeOffsEn: Listening to residents early and offsetting impacts helps; always
    giving in pushes projects into neighborhoods with no voice.
  _sources:
  - Label: NIMBY (Wikipedia)
    Url: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/NIMBY
  _relatedEntries:
